    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for writing a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_base_entity_set" kindref="compound">BaseEntitySet</ref></computeroutput> to the graph store. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementations can target:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>ThemisDB internal graph store (production)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>In-memory store (tests / development)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>External graph DB (neo4j, ArangoDB — via plugins)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-safety: <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_i_graph_writer_1ab446339f0e464bc89a3ca72fe1ad1ec2" kindref="member">writeEntities()</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_i_graph_writer_1a2875793205ed61ad54fbac71fa094109" kindref="member">writeRelations()</ref></computeroutput> MUST be thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
